      <Comment>Salicylate is widely used in organic synthesis and functions as a plant hormone. The source of the name |FRAME: CPD-110| (salicylic acid) comes from the name of the willow tree, |FRAME:TAX-40685|, from whose bark it can be obtained.</Comment>
